# TqSdk Boundary

TqSdk credentials must only come from environment variables.

Allowed environment variable names are TQ_USER and TQ_PASS.

Never hardcode TqSdk credentials.

Never write real TQ_USER values into the repository.

Never write real TQ_PASS values into the repository.

Default tests must not require real TqSdk credentials.

Default tests must not make live TqSdk calls.

Default tests must not make live network calls.

Do not import or instantiate real TqApi unless the current GitHub Issue explicitly allows it.

Do not implement a TqSdk downloader unless the current GitHub Issue explicitly allows it.

TASK-007 only allows a source adapter skeleton.

TASK-007 does not allow live connection.

TASK-007 does not allow downloader implementation.

TASK-007 does not allow real data download.

Use fake environment variables in tests.

Use optional dependency guards when needed.
